<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-REAL MADRID CONFIRM KARANKA MOVE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-REAL MADRID CONFIRM KARANKA MOVE.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Real Madrid confirmed on Thursday that international defender Aitor Karanka had joined them from Athletic Bilbao.</p>
<p>Karanka has signed a five-year contract with the Spanish champions.</p>
<p>Real are believed to have paid one billion pesetas ($6.6 million) to buy out his contract.</p>
